@startuml c4_context
' C4 niveau 1 — Contexte système · CLAIRE Studio
' Aligné sur CONTRACT.md (rôles, sources LLM, fichiers) et navigation.md.
title CLAIRE Studio — Diagramme de contexte (C4 niveau 1)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #334155
}

actor "Annotateur\n(annotator)" as Annotator
actor "Reviewer\n(reviewer)" as Reviewer
actor "Lead de campagne\n(project lead)" as Lead
actor "Admin / Owner" as Admin

rectangle "CLAIRE Studio\n\nAtelier web d'annotation juridique\n(segmentation en clauses + thèmes\n+ certitude, gold humain traçable)" as System #D1FAE5

rectangle "Pré-annotations LLM\n(Claude / Codex)\nplans v9.2 / v9.4" as LLM #FEF3C7
rectangle "Corpus juridiques\nCLAUDETTE-ToS, CUAD,\nLEDGAR, ContractNLI…" as Corpus #FEF3C7
rectangle "Dossiers de traductions\n(file-based, feature 8)" as Translations #FEF3C7
rectangle "Consommateurs d'export\n(recherche, notebooks, HF Hub)" as Exports #FEF3C7

Annotator --> System : annote des documents\n(workspace, clavier)
Reviewer --> System : relit, note, commente
Lead --> System : suit avancement + IAA (kappa)
Admin --> System : importe corpus, configure\nschemes, projets, exports

System <-- Corpus : import documents\n+ reference_labels (feature 12)
System <-- LLM : import pré-annotations\n(feature 2, pivot clause)
System <-- Translations : pointeurs + sync\n(feature 8, file-based)
System --> Exports : exports multi-format\n(jsonl/csv/conll/xml/md/hf, feature 5)

@enduml
